      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Requires the Stem Studio integration in ComfyUI/custom_nodes/StemStudio (installed by the Stem Studio setup) and the model files it prepared. Put your file in ComfyUI/input and pick it in Load Audio (video files work too). Outputs are FLAC files in ComfyUI/output/StemStudio.\n\nThe brush of Stem Studio as plain ComfyUI nodes. Needs stable_audio_3_small_sfx.safetensors (checkpoints) and t5gemma_b_b_ul2.safetensors (text encoders) from huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/stable-audio-3, under the Stability AI Community License. Edit the prompt and the length in Empty Latent Audio (seconds). Restore Range places the painted clip at start_seconds on the full length of the loaded file and leaves the rest silent, so the result lines up with your timeline."
      ]
    },
